    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">com-mītĭgo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-m-</span></b> ),
